12486	https://servicenow.iu.edu/kb?id=kb_article_view&sys_kb_id=b89d0a9c4736f6d0d500b87b716d435c	Monitoring configuration for Kubernetes applications	Monitoring is provided by the\nPrometheus\nmonitoring and alerting toolkit.\nTo monitor your application, add the following label to your deployment:\nlaunchpad\n.iu\n.edu\n/monitoringClass: spring-boot\nIf you are using\nhelm-k8s-boot\n, add the following configuration to your values file to enable monitoring:\nmetrics:\nenabled:\ntrue	KB0027187	KB0027187 v3.0	Monitoring is provided by the Prometheus monitoring and alerting toolkit. To monitor your application, add the following label to your deployment: launchpad.iu.edu/monitoringClass: spring-boot\r\n If you are using helm-k8s-boot, add the following configuration to your values file to enable monitoring: metrics:\r\n  enabled: true	315.1584	km-aud-iu-all	2026-01-31 17:36:51.676132	2026-01-31 17:36:51.676132	0	b89d0a9c4736f6d0d500b87b716d435c
12489	https://servicenow.iu.edu/kb?id=kb_article_view&sys_kb_id=6dee86dc47f6f6d0d500b87b716d43af	Links to official Kubernetes, Helm, and Docker glossaries	Table of contents\nOverview\nGlossaries\nOther terms\nOverview\nThis page is intended to provide references to official glossaries and a list of terminologies that are used in the IU Kubernetes documentation.\nGlossaries\nKubernetes Glossary\nHelm Glossary\nDocker Glossary\nOther terms\nOther terms\nTerm\nDescription\nTKGI\nTKGI is an abbreviation for\nTanzu Kubernetes Grid Integrated Edition\nby VMWare, as well as a command-line utility for authenticating with the service.\nTeam namespace\nThe Kubernetes namespace given to a team at IU, following this format:\n<organization>--<department>--<team>\n(for example,\nua-vpit--enterprise-systems--esimw\n)	KB0027190	KB0027190 v3.0	 references to official glossaries and a list of terminologies that are used in the IU <strong>Kubernetes</strong> documentation. Glossaries <strong>Kubernetes</strong> Glossary Helm Glossary Docker Glossary Other terms Other terms Term Description TKGI TKGI is an abbreviation for Tanzu <strong>Kubernetes</strong> Grid Integrated Edition by VMWare, as well	312.2048	km-aud-iu-all	2026-01-31 17:36:55.079799	2026-01-31 17:36:55.079799	0	6dee86dc47f6f6d0d500b87b716d43af
